{
  "name": "Shipments 4 · Product mix",
  "collection": "drill-path",
  "description": "Layer 4: one customer's product mix within one industry. Click another industry under 'This customer also ships to' to switch industry for the same customer.",
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "industry",
      "name": "Industry",
      "slug": "industry",
      "type": "string/=",
      "sectionId": "string",
      "default": [
        "Widget"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "id": "customer",
      "name": "Customer",
      "slug": "customer",
      "type": "string/=",
      "sectionId": "string",
      "default": [
        "Ted Weber"
      ],
      "required": true
    }
  ],
  "dashcards": [
    {
      "card_id": null,
      "row": 0,
      "col": 0,
      "size_x": 24,
      "size_y": 2,
      "parameter_mappings": [
        {
          "parameter_id": "industry",
          "target": [
            "text-tag",
            "industry"
          ]
        },
        {
          "parameter_id": "customer",
          "target": [
            "text-tag",
            "customer"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "visualization_settings": {
        "virtual_card": {
          "name": null,
          "display": "text",
          "visualization_settings": {},
          "dataset_query": {},
          "archived": false
        },
        "text": "## {{customer}} in {{industry}}\n[Company](/dashboard/@@dashboard:dashboards/company.json@@) › [Industries](/dashboard/@@dashboard:dashboards/industries.json@@) › [{{industry}}](/dashboard/@@dashboard:dashboards/customers.json@@?industry={{industry}}) › **{{customer}}**. Click another industry on the right to see this customer's mix there."
      }
    },
    {
      "card_id": "@card:cards/product_mix.json",
      "row": 2,
      "col": 0,
      "size_x": 14,
      "size_y": 9,
      "parameter_mappings": [
        {
          "parameter_id": "industry",
          "card_id": "@card:cards/product_mix.json",
          "target": [
            "variable",
            [
              "template-tag",
              "industry"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "parameter_id": "customer",
          "card_id": "@card:cards/product_mix.json",
          "target": [
            "variable",
            [
              "template-tag",
              "customer"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "visualization_settings": {}
    },
    {
      "card_id": "@card:cards/customer_industries.json",
